t: A Jira-only rebar-id:<UUID> label must not produce a label-removal mutation.\t53\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_outbound_effective_map_cache_d378.py\tD:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_outbound_effective_map_cache_d378.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_outbound_effective_map_cache_d378.py#D:<module>\tpytest: Effective mappings are cached once per project within an outbound pass. These tests count discovery calls, distinguish project keys, and check each project's create payload.\t204\t25\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py\tD:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py#D:<module>\tpytest: Exercise real outbound and inbound differs together when Jira removes a parent. Outbound must not restore an observed peer removal, but must propagate a later local re-parent.\t372\t27\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py\tD:_FakeBindingStore\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py#D:_FakeBindingStore\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py#D:_FakeBindingStore\tpytest: Expose bindings and the parent last observed on Jira; absent peer evidence must not authorize a clear.\t65\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py\tD:_local_tickets\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_pare