/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py#D:test_inbound_clear_survives_a_real_bidirectional_pass\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py#D:test_inbound_clear_survives_a_real_bidirectional_pass\tpytest: Feed real outbound mutations into inbound; an observed Jira removal must clear the local parent.\t127\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py\tD:test_outbound_STILL_pushes_a_parent_the_local_side_re_set\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py#D:test_outbound_STILL_pushes_a_parent_the_local_side_re_set\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py#D:test_outbound_STILL_pushes_a_parent_the_local_side_re_set\tpytest: A local re-parent after the last peer observation must still be sent outbound.\t117\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py\tD:test_outbound_does_not_re_push_a_parent_the_peer_removed\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py#D:test_outbound_does_not_re_push_a_parent_the_peer_removed\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_bidirectional_37e7.py#D:test_outbound_does_not_re_push_a_parent_the_peer_removed\tpytest: An observed Jira parent removal must not trigger an outbound re-parent.\t172\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py\tD:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py#D:<module>\tpytest: Inbound parent clears require both an observed parentless peer and evidence that Jira previously held the parent. Locally managed refs alone do not prove peer ownership; both no-clear and real-clear controls are required.\t373\t33\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py\tD:_FakeBindingStore\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py#D:_FakeBindingStore\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py#D:_FakeBindingStore\tpytest: Expose the last parent observed on Jira; missing evidence must prevent a clear.\t85\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py\tD:_child\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py#D:_child\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py#D:_child\tpytest: Give the child a locally managed parent without implying Jira ever held it.\t63\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py\tD:test_a_parent_the_peer_never_had_is_not_cleared\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py#D:test_a_parent_the_peer_never_had_is_not_cleared\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py#D:test_a_parent_the_peer_never_had_is_not_cleared\tpytest: A local parent never observed on Jira must survive a parentless Jira snapshot.\t96\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py\tD:test_a_parent_the_peer_once_had_is_cleared\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py#D:test_a_parent_the_peer_once_had_is_cleared\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py#D:test_a_parent_the_peer_once_had_is_cleared\tpytest: A parent previously observed on Jira must clear when Jira now reports none.\t82\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py\tD:test_an_unobserved_parent_is_never_cleared_even_with_peer_evidence\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py#D:test_an_unobserved_parent_is_never_cleared_even_with_peer_evidence\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_clear_requires_peer_evidence.py#D:test_an_unobserved_parent_is_never_cleared_even_with_peer_evidence\tpytest: An omitted parent field is not an observed clear, even with prior peer evidence.\t73\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_detach_sync.py\tD:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_detach_sync.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_detach_sync.py#D:<module>\tpytest: A local detach clears a managed Jira parent so inbound cannot restore it. A parent set only by a Jira user remains available for inbound adoption.\t139\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_detach_sync.py\tD:test_unmanaged_jira_parent_is_not_cleared\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_detach_sync.py#D:test_unmanaged_jira_parent_is_not_cleared\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_detach_sync.py#D:test_unmanaged_jira_parent_is_not_cleared\tpytest: A Jira parent outside managed_refs must not be cleared by outbound sync.\t39\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_drop_parity_8390.py\tD:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_drop_parity_8390.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_drop_parity_8390.py#D:<module>\tpytest: A bound parent dropped during create mapping or rejected by Jira's attach call must leave a durable bridge alert. Unbound, converged, and successful parents stay silent; recording must not change payloads or control flow.\t526\t34\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_drop_parity_8390.py\tD:_alert_kinds\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_drop_parity_8390.py#D:_alert_kinds\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_drop_parity_8390.py#D:_alert_kinds\tpytest: Read durable bridge-alert kinds from the repository, rather than an in-memory sink.\t45\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_drop_parity_8390.py\tD:_tickets\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_drop_parity_8390.py#D:_tickets\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_drop_parity_8390.py#D:_tickets\tpytest: Build an unbound child with a configurable parent type and binding state.\t52\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_drop_parity_8390.py\tD:_update_drop\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_parent_drop_parity_8390.py#D:_update_drop\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/unit